msgid "Writes four records in a fixed order and touches the corpus graph in none of them — dublin-core as the record of truth, a manifest that references it, assets[] kept as a SIBLING of library: because that tree is regenerated and would drop anything written inside it, and finally the slug binding Task_Link depends on. Getting the order or the placement wrong here is invisible until the next sync silently drops it."
